 Sneakers-PAM appliance  Recover access                   sneakers.example.org
 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 When every admin key is lost, this adds a key to an owner, or makes a new
 owner, through the enrolment window: a code shown here, then a typed yes.

 It's recorded in the OS audit log, every other owner sees a banner on :8443,
 and the new key can't approve elevations for 24 hours (another owner can lift
 that).

 Owners: alice
 Type an owner's name to add a key to them, or a new name to make a new owner.

 "Root" can't be an admin name: use 2 to 31 lowercase letters, digits, _ or -,
 starting with a letter, and not a reserved name.






